+The multiple-of-3 rule uses the original delimiter run length, so the
+remainder of a partially consumed run can still match a later delimiter.
+
+```````````````````````````````` example
+*a***a*
+.
+<p><em>a</em>*<em>a</em></p>
+````````````````````````````````
+
+```````````````````````````````` example
+*foo***bar*
+.
+<p><em>foo</em>*<em>bar</em></p>
+````````````````````````````````
+
 
